  "title": "Data and Metadata Standards",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>The PanKbase Consortium has defined comprehensive, rigorous standards for metadata and data processing to encourage transparency, reproducibility, and dissemination. View our standards below:</p><p>Metadata Standards:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://data.pankbase.org/standards/human-donor\">Human Donors</a></li><li><a href=\"https://data.pankbase.org/standards/islet-biosample\">Islet Biosamples</a></li><li><a href=\"https://data.pankbase.org/beta-cell-line-metadata/\">Human Beta Cell Lines</a></li><li><a href=\"https://data.pankbase.org/standards/file-formats/\">File Formats</a></li><li><a href=\"https://data.pankbase.org/standards/sequence-based-assays-metadata-standards\">Sequence-based Experiments</a></li><li><a href=\"https://data.pankbase.org/standards/islet-function-experiment\">Islet Function Experiment</a></li></ul><p>Data Processing Standards:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://data.pankbase.org/standards/bulk-rna-data/\">Bulk RNA-seq</a></li><li><a href=\"https://data.pankbase.org/pipelines/sn-scrnaseq-pipeline_hv/\">Single Cell RNA-seq (scRNA-seq)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://data.pankbase.org/standards/single-cell-atac-data/\">Single Nucleus ATAC-seq (snATAC-seq)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://data.pankbase.org/standards/islet-dynamic-perifusion&#13;\">Islet Dynamic Perifusion</a></li></ul>",
